{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-speed-meter#caveat-1","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-speed-meter","commit":"78ff1990dd3d0c21b080a49a2ec903abc6f322fd","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-speed-meter 使用进程内存保存调用与校准状态，DSH 进程重启后数据会清空；未收到最终 usage 的调用只能按历史比例估算。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:35-70","lib/index.js:260-275"]}
